{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11307150","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11307150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130715001:1":{"text":"친구들과 놀러 갔네. 오랜만에 만나서 그런지 한바탕 다투더니 또 몇 분이 지나니 화해하더군. 하하, 아이들이란.","source_cn":"去和朋友们玩了，他们那么久没见，先是大吵一架，过几分钟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8051715081E915F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130715002:1":{"text":"아직도 딸아이에게 진실을 알려주지는 않았어. 아이들은 아직 어려서 무슨 일이 생긴 건지 제대로 알지도 못할 테니.","source_cn":"我始终没有告诉女儿真相，那些孩子们年纪小，也没明白之前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A2D3764E92C16FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130715003:1":{"text":"어찌 보면 이게 낫지. 몇 년이 지나면 이 나쁜 경험을 잊을 수도 있으니.","source_cn":"这样也好，或许再过几年，他们就会把这段糟糕的经历忘了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50CC98F8DCCCB1EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:部落成员登利":{"text":"덴리","source":"部落成员登利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}